    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 308 of the laws of 2012, amending the general\nmunicipal law relating to providing local governments greater contract\nflexibility and cost savings by permitting certain shared purchasing among\npolitical subdivisions, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
